  "steps": [
    "Nachos: take 1 tortilla (wholewheat) / 1 big chapati. Cut it into triangles.",
    "Spray oil, add salt and pepper.",
    "Airfry at 160 degrees for 8-10 mins (keep checking and flipping midway) or bake at 180 for 8-10 mins (make sure to preheat oven).",
    "Let it sit for 5 mins and enjoy your crispy nachos!",
    "Guacamole (optional): mash 1/2 an avocado with tomato, onion and coriander.",
    "Add lemon juice, salt, pepper and mixed herbs.",
    "Salsa: add 1/2 chopped onion, 1 tomato, and lemon juice to a handchopper.",
    "Also add ketchup, salt and pepper and then grind it all well.",
    "Cheesy dip: blend 100g low fat paneer, 60g greek yogurt, soaked dried red chillies and salt until creamy (Refrigerate for 10 mins).",
    "Assemble and enjoy."
